lzy|n|of Double ; The act of one that doubles; a making double; reduplication; also, that which is doubled. ; A turning and winding; as, the doubling of a hunted hare; shift; trick; artifice. ; The lining of the mantle borne about the shield or escutcheon. ; The process of redistilling spirits, to improve the strength and flavor.	a:1491,2,1~1491,2,1
